Z||000007||G-Nasty||01-19-2001||12:11 AM||||I got mine from fierostore.com they will ship it overnight if need be. It is a pain in the ass to install but you should be able to remove the old one and install new one in about 2 hrs. Good luck and get ready to curse alot...||||reg||1
